<title>USA: Genesco names Ben Harris CEO.</title>
<headline>Genesco names Ben Harris CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Footwear distributor Genesco Inc said on Monday that Ben Harris, 53, became chief executive with effect from February 1.</p>
<p>Harris, who has been with the company 30 years, was appointed president and chief operating officer in November, and Genesco said at that time it expected him to replace David Chamberlain as chief executive too.</p>
<p>Chamberlain remains chairman. ((-- New York Newsrom 212 859 1610))</p>
